---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="VIP Peptides is a UK supplier of research-grade peptides, built around independent batch testing and straightforward documentation."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>A supplier that shows its working</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="lede">
        {site.name} exists because buying research peptides in the UK is unnecessarily opaque. Too
        much of the market runs on unbranded vials, recycled certificates and claims nobody can
        check.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do differently</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the catalogue deliberately small. Every line is one we can source consistently from
        a partner we have reviewed, hold in stock in the UK, and document properly. When we cannot
        do all three, we do not list it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every batch goes to an independent laboratory before release — not the manufacturer's own
        lab. The certificate of analysis is batch-specific and we will send it to you before you
        order. If a batch does not meet specification it does not get sold; it does not quietly
        become the next batch.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we supply</h2>
      <p>
        University departments, contract research organisations, formulation chemists and private
        laboratories. We handle purchase orders, bulk quantities and custom vial sizes through the
        same enquiry route as everything else.
      </p>

      <h2>What we will not do</h2>
      <p>
        We do not give dosing advice, administration protocols, or guidance of any kind on use in
        humans or animals — not as a formality, but because our products are not for that and we
        are not qualified to. If you ask, we will decline, politely and every time.
      </p>
      <p>
        We also will not make therapeutic claims about anything we sell. Where the research
        literature is interesting, we will point you at it and let you read it yourself.
      </p>

      <h2>Where we are</h2>
      <p>
        We are based in the United Kingdom and ship domestically on a tracked service. Contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>; we answer
        {' '}{site.contact.hours.toLowerCase()}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 1.8rem + 3.5vw, 4.5rem) 0;
  }

  .page-head h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
</style>
